    "custom_multicolumns_xpBCAp": {
      "type": "custom-multicolumns",
      "blocks": {
        "column_W4R47Y": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "link": "",
            "dynamic_costs": "",
            "custom_text_hover": "",
            "title": "",
            "show_text_double_column": false,
            "text": "<p>We are very happy to welcome you to deVOL in Manhattan, it’s our first showroom outside the British Isles. We have always had such great support from the people of New York and across the United States, so we felt this was the perfect spot to introduce ourselves. <br/><br/></p><p>Bond Street is located in between The Bowery and Lafayette Street, off East 2nd Street in East Village, an area known as NoHo. It’s a beautiful wide cobbled street with incredible architecture and a very bohemian history of artists, musicians and creatives.</p>",
            "show_above_image": true,
            "link_label": "",
            "linked_product": ""
          }
        },
        "column_fB3ekK": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "link": "",
            "dynamic_costs": "",
            "custom_text_hover": "",
            "title": "",
            "show_text_double_column": false,
            "text": "<p>Bond Street has long been associated with furniture and after the inevitable gentrification, has kept its charm and character and is a delightfully quiet part of town. <br/><br/></p><p>We have created four beautifully appointed kitchen displays in the main showroom, there is also a basement and yard full of vintage furniture, antiques and brocante. Lovely places for lunch are The Smile next door, or Il Buco Alimentari & Vineria on Great Jones Street which is open all day every day and is just a 3 minute walk from the showroom.</p>",
            "show_above_image": true,
            "link_label": "",
            "linked_product": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "column_W4R47Y",
        "column_fB3ekK"
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "custom_css": [
